# No environment variables are required for local development.
# On macOS, development uses the computer's stable Bonjour name automatically.
# Elsewhere, set a DNS name that resolves from every client (not an IP address).
# KERCAD_CANONICAL_HOST=cad.school.example
# Set to off to keep direct access by IP/localhost, e.g. when diagnosing DNS.
# KERCAD_CANONICAL_HOST=off
